{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/63859-identity-theft-how-far-does-it-go","id":63859,"title":"Identity Theft - How Far Does It Go?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-03T03:49:48-08:00","id":63859,"title":"Identity Theft - How Far Does It Go?","content":"As the title says. How far does this embed go? The flavour says that the demon\u2019s face only subtly shifts and her voice and mannerisms change to mimic the target - is this DNA altering or cosmic cosmetic surgery changing the demons face? Is it human experiences/memories shaping said mannerisms and voice or genetics? Does the demon change gender, ethnicity or height? The flavour is pretty weak on the actual description of what happens to the demon physically and mentally.<br /> <br /> A success means the demon gains access to all the targets social merits, so I'm assuming it should work well enough to trick family and life long friends. What if the target has resources that are protected by finger print, retina scan, blood test or even a question that only the target would know? In summation, how far does this embed go?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Some day we'll look back on this, laugh awkwardly and change the subject.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1889-thefrigidmidget","name":"TheFrigidMidget","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1889_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-03T05:06:00-08:00","id":63882,"title":"","content":"I would assume yes. Identity theft seems to be a &quot;here, have a temporary Cover&quot; power. You don't get the mechanical rating of a new Cover, but apparently the social ratings that usually come with cover. You get the appearance of said cover. I'd say that its enough to fool finger print or eye scans. Demons are rewriting reality in a quantum state, after all, not actually shape shifting. <br /> <br /> So, I'd say yes. It has a bit of overlap with Authorized, in that you can assume the identity of someone that IS authorized, but Identity Theft requires finding a person, giving a touch, and may lead back to the real person and get them in trouble, while the latter doesn't care about others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-14T17:06:51-08:00","id":72327,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/63859-identity-theft-how-far-does-it-go?p=63882#post63882\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Demons are rewriting reality in a quantum state, after all, not actually shape shifting.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the reply MCN. That was actually the major part of the embed that I couldn't understand. All embeds are pretty much the demon rewriting some bit of cosmic code, so if the demon rewrites it to say &quot;this person isn't who he is, I'm who he is and always has been&quot; he shouldn't need the subtly shifting features etc. as everyone would just remember the demon instead of the other person. However if he removes the identity from the target and slips into his life, then I'd think he would become that person, right down to the very core. It'd be interesting to see what the developers had in mind creating the embed.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Some day we'll look back on this, laugh awkwardly and change the subject.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1889-thefrigidmidget","name":"TheFrigidMidget","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1889_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}